### get all
GET http://localhost:3000/Contacts

### get by id
GET http://localhost:3000/Contacts/6908efbb6e24464c89f46e40

### create new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/Contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Mike",
    "lastName": "Scott",
    "email": "mike.scott@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Yellow",
    "birthday": "06/15/75"
}

### update contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/Contacts/6908f07e6e24464c89f46e41 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jordan",
    "lastName": "Perterson",
    "email": "jordan.perterson@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "12/11/20"
}

### delete contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/Contacts/6908f0ad6e24464c89f46e42 HTTP/1.1